  "title": "Customers Are Looking to Insurers for Stability in 2021",
  "summary": "Like everyone else, insurers have had a tough year with COVID-19 and the ensuing economic uncertainty. The sudden re-modelling of their businesses around mass working from home, the collapse in the markets for travel and other insurance products through to the difficulties around claims for business interruption insurance, are all factors that have affected insurers and their relations with customers.",
